{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2860037e401be47e211d04bb7b0c598cf5ffd31335cd57296c510339da6798c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2962bd03062b0429e40949230abdadb4b4aee699bca0154025e19c7e2a17b3ee",
      "text": "庆祝就要用惊喜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d83ed68026d9e08487639704d0516c618b12f47b939f05be78999231efc87b72",
      "text": "马上就是隼人的生日了，四季等人计划举办一场惊喜派对。虽然瞒着隼人立即开始做准备，但面对与往常不同的成员们的表现，隼人却察觉到了异样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000026:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000026:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2962bd03062b0429e40949230abdadb4b4aee699bca0154025e19c7e2a17b3ee",
      "text": "庆祝就要用惊喜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9994a404281bf3c93c33cb05482f1e057012c1dcaea2d23b1a43fb54e2333ab",
      "text": "锵锵！\n突击提问时间！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae9946b4d17d642d9b40a9008dc7d28003f851fa20fa892b97aaf9a53c18f04d",
      "text": "11月22日是什么日子呢！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1133d4f75ab3b45f30304a0e6a9dfa6a305fcab776f750d5d8ff6579c501ce5a",
      "text": "……汪汪喵喵之日……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c587c9a2032dec22edf6329169e719eb899c912f80f0a083285b37d22f105b03",
      "text": "是小测验的日子呢。\n四季君，你有好好学习吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9109d70a15e9735acabbe1ef442fccfce4746f56b29cb916384a58ea2200d9da",
      "text": "咯噔！\n嘟、嘟——！两个人都回答错误！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5422d169c859553da5acc230644b0d94a7e7c3ef218e34ea208ed23511ea372b",
      "text": "哈哈，其实你们两个都心知肚明吧。\n是隼人的生日对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e8516ea92c00d46dcec5900652fc1839eb6a7646c6c3fa689fd0f93aac14899",
      "text": "春名亲～不愧是你！\n说到生日，那要做的事情就只有一件了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78625bdd9b55aa2e92ed39b09fd6f8693e1888767d9f88ed68bb3bc0642ab097",
      "text": "大家一起准备派对，\n给隼人亲一个超级大惊喜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf4472048172efa871cacfde8c1d0cc1d047bb6c9e729d7a2a44b60b0c0d8a11",
      "text": "惊喜派对……真不错呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29f44f6ac3c69d28ffa5def3bea536e4a8d87a9da5542b1de9ade2e98e7a2d73",
      "text": "就是说嘛！难得的机会，\n也让●●●●プロデューサー一起帮忙吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e462d70cb7f8437d82a3f2f97f229175c73005d5ae3ee0f5492632f7d87fcba1",
      "text": "我回来啦！社长会议开得好长……\n哎，大家在聊什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b77ada17ac8e03050cd760738bd48a544dd56c5e7019c4d445107d9a83ab7ed0",
      "text": "……秘密。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:917a688ba45147b40c1fd0b316d04e24382bd266f579189cfc9392e26185f705",
      "text": "诶——！好在意啊快告诉我啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b306834e34d7759c611348231fd8dbf119039e1eb20db29f0056b748075584e1",
      "text": "没什么大不了的。只是在聊\n让四季君去备考复习的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9c7add1320a57a9ebcd6ff000c77483df11bbedfc105ab3f1c7549fd2c0e6e5",
      "text": "哇啊——！\n听不见听不见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a8ea6b18d4a801e522ddf4b322a8943937cb6a36f70f6f504d7248fd65ae1f1",
      "text": "哈哈……四季还是老样子啊。\n那么，我们开始练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000215:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4e875a26e6efa9aee57467f129e845f7f25965e0d87d7a08f0b7b20c7e422fa",
      "text": "噢。\n今天也充满干劲地上吧——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac90dbb4e2a5f05cb0f3a816055242311160fd2f19261cbb963a4646a61abac7",
      "text": "碰头会到这里就结束了。\n辛苦了，各位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56ffc116f1f9114047d651a0b44d3299563e45e19ab9e4a696a1954a8ea5f49f",
      "text": "辛苦啦！\n我说我说，等下大家要不要顺路去哪逛逛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4db4801187a3d6053572feeab9fe23dcd9e1da4cf0e34d87837f210e72d1fa0",
      "text": "啊——……超想去的，\n可是今天稍微有点事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8bb8d0442a6239dbc11ff56f95d5452e3e605ecbb861ea9b27438215d2afa7d",
      "text": "我还有事要和●●●●プロデューサー\n谈，我就不去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a9ab7e59f4217cd5cba16fc7a61238f6616871e5505558bc05d56cef1048867",
      "text": "我也是……有事要找●●●●プロデューサー\n商量……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d808ddef2e91893edd3ad9ce10e618213c522a9e069248649507d3ce8007ba",
      "text": "啊，我有空哦，隼人！\n难得有空，去吃点甜食吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:570f350953fc12a5b708bf4509e1687d0736d74efe6629914ead9c5b52a1dc32",
      "text": "我知道一家很推荐的甜甜圈店哦。\n走吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af1657267e2893be355b2eefcc42d7711a2267847ac4952da42952e30fd7a72c",
      "text": "哇，不用推我我也能走啦！\n那大家下次再一起玩吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000132:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1af139110744b9f6e364d59b7bdf52358721564949d0c7e3df9ef2e4b1806a4d",
      "text": "又过了几天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c807094f86752c8b1a0aaef444fa8c7330d66d4faf619278ad980a9534b38a06",
      "text": "今天的练习就到这里！\n那收拾一下就回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81198516f16f7902c18219a289af195a6ad6b4f4c63f7cea27b9f2be2b2f32fd",
      "text": "抱歉啊。\n我总觉得教师办公室好像找我有事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e66147fec05676d86bab1d20c6a1294fa8a9a91d69a82ca0b818e8536331e2cd",
      "text": "我、我也是！\n事情Mega Mega多得堆成山了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df28756cce7c319cd1e3be01348d00cc2833320db34a3e1e075741432e1aa462",
      "text": "哎？现在去？那回去要很晚了吧。\n有什么我能帮上忙的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b1c9370ba82e82ae05ac73fc36d2a50da8b94ce38ff5ca2e014e337363a3261",
      "text": "他们两个肯定又是被叫去训话了。\n不用放在心上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be96d9182ddf1ae6eda86270d136dbf69ad22c387f938d177f89d9227493a9c1",
      "text": "……一起回去吧……隼人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9811d46d09c8e2a306625c4c2269e6906d554e945328984b65bc54d18fa7de43",
      "text": "嗯、嗯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_b:cmd-000213:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fea14373030f77fe59b8e828b607a745b9576347d4420757e783504fbaf52ab2",
      "text": "……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09b91c23f33b227d1f6ce1d54bb2f44c1606615af9453c60f29ca3f99a14434b",
      "text": "隼人的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb1eda21f96ea58e82b76ff226a670e3e058c4087f12d05e17c8478a7df4b885",
      "text": "……好奇怪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89cf5e0a2811a19856b94be1943cde6c1c47492a237cf5825dda7f14f88dd435",
      "text": "（最近大家到底怎么了。\n总觉得心神不宁的，感觉怪怪的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca4d3cef0f7c045a12abc01b0824c16c0e3884c42842bfc0cc631c433fc1d3a0",
      "text": "简直就像是在瞒着我\n做些什么事情一样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5792ce177f4c52cffc2a94c217d33b9e6af21ed2feb623e3fc5d2397b4d6fa30",
      "text": "（关于曲子的事肯定会跟我商量的，\n除了那个还有什么事吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b0a00d2b47281b39e97b4e7adaa7c253c557e170e463d50f94437b4b9b81a97",
      "text": "……啊！\n马上就是我的生日了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3561370fafe246c7da60d87f0f446dfae5832ca0bed999258d0d0abcc9767d7",
      "text": "难道说……大家是打算在生日那天\n为我准备什么吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06547054b16ed792024acfbb9821e88c8b59c758a7ad9527340943c734ba770d",
      "text": "不不怎么可能……！但是看大家的\n表现，可能性并不是零啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a734478cda415d4d1301d728bac25a7c06973f8225834fa5d71351e89a9dd21",
      "text": "哇——……要是真的那我可太开心了。\n糟了，嘴角忍不住翘起来了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64934f52fd86dce837d31dbc239e997783a0245f24403bf888a51d147bbe0bcf",
      "text": "不行不行，既然大家是在秘密准备，\n那我就得装作没发现才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57e646db24c7bd1cdda0f8fbb16e383858e0e61acc45cb22dddd6c6fe66beb0b",
      "text": "嗯。我什么都不知道！什么都没看见，\n什么都没察觉到！就按这个路线来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e22aa7fb7ef9910db7b83208cedceae55551502bc2a9893a2ea162ce2fd9518",
      "text": "……好期待啊。嘿嘿……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59278d62b7763a1bc139f864621817142674d3f6d2381aeb282b782701b78988",
      "text": "早上好，旬！\n今天的碰头会也请多指教！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3677701f82850e244630f90ea0e3b45ef3611a184778d790d238ac68d310f23b",
      "text": "好的，请多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddde52868db40bfdee6f18e3727a0555a211dceb5e2a9201fd923c245b286917",
      "text": "……总觉得你心情很好呢。\n遇到什么好事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e557dd75a84e90e47efe30a34df902d6d27421baedfcf797014871ff061cfa8",
      "text": "哎？没那回事啦。不过，令人开心的事\n接下来可能确实会有就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ba5563d58085a4eb50c62ea5138137bc06370f88056f1ee53ba4d7cfc25be8f",
      "text": "啊，没有，刚才的话当我没说！\n快忘了快忘了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e5212b5f769f96503052fb33d696500eae035c83a11d6beac46e79f4a3dcdee",
      "text": "哇啊，是蛋糕的商品目录！\n看起来每一个都好好吃啊……嘿嘿，真期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e910ee05f5cca888c5efbe562481b44e69377e99f9ee76977238ec96ae5f788f",
      "text": "（这……绝对是察觉到惊喜的事了吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f9ef42ccad879aabea252b0d7606b89723b3dc625f673c25eb15b4b5733c4bc",
      "text": "那个，旬先生。\n关于隼人先生的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3ec9bcebd9b6a3d44a12733f9735871a25e06e38af88e9708efa00d94e1008e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー也\n注意到了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:667ce7940898708a6d58a3f479ba8873094745499228495947cbcef6129cbac9",
      "text": "是的……该怎么办呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b40c775348ea27a1ee7c7bec0a67f5f04d37948bbd1dc4d4754d73fe5a2414dd",
      "text": "感觉会变得很麻烦，\n还是先别告诉他们本人了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19c62cc9662801e40884d2366a92df8a9d617af0c9a027a75c647c39ff9bee1a",
      "text": "说的也是呢。大家的计划也进入收尾阶段了，\n我也尽量表现得和平常一样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4dfe7e97f80b21f6220f3a5726c6a59ad7ec18af40d869729bae416175b2d17",
      "text": "早上好。\n还有，祝你生日快乐，隼人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9503c93f44351b4566b6181b3b71966161f2b64ee62c047887312bf0541274ad",
      "text": "生日快乐秋山同学！要开心度过这一天哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3108721c4fe76a097ac0a53a573868e46b8c5af990fb6a7690e85f9c433e20fe",
      "text": "谢谢大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a574bd4bf45c43eeeee65f8b8567f438204f5ae74e28e18fcba2165e8eceaaa9",
      "text": "（没想到一大早\n就能得到大家的祝福啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfa79ec3535133fae054ac345fc216d440822abcef869debc6e6be6dbbf9e81a",
      "text": "哎？课桌里塞了什么东西。\n信封……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b187e24261e3fe9a154b1c12a0411700f7a00ec1a93cb1fcfabd03540501923",
      "text": "“今天放学后，事务所集合！”\n……这是四季的字迹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b482249dd3d6b3f86aef665a73dfd5d667f45fb2b4484ead6f3661535e642920",
      "text": "也就是说……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000091:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15646b13b9f99fca4055ea9f9c4e7c45f92d5400293db167ef0ac2ecf5690da",
      "text": "放学后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3209d39a908190fd7e5d4c68e5baa1a5ea93f09adeef6a37c06e05459b797d17",
      "text": "派对的邀请函我已经塞进\n隼人亲的课桌里了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0172e3e04a55476b4f17abe26b9d4e14ece4b121ec3c0838fd429a8f656fc481",
      "text": "接下来就只等本人过来了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50bee9a7c222b8d0cad2355bf3d1743e09f12e1664cbae48f737a5a0715a7fb6",
      "text": "是的！要彻底瞒住他，\n可费了Mega Mega大的功夫呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68372620c4fac7ee0e4b6762b01a81ecaf3595e39f588c51af33200fc1a09c38",
      "text": "是啊……一直在提心吊胆\n会不会穿帮……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15e8a83d036f0f884eb54a5e24cfafba1be0db8f0f8260f37b73d7bb6effa0da",
      "text": "噢，隼人来联络了。\n说马上就到事务所了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ac44840bbba3396ae470ced15b5070ddf8b4a9ce4d208b51104318f757e7bf0",
      "text": "了解。大家各就各位吧。\n●●●●プロデューサー也拜托了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1040a94dfb84b35cba145968ac4797fefa453b570ae1b8977b5a1e37b764ea03",
      "text": "好的，交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d9e8f01c4bba42f7a686c8cf5f547acf5288977353313fb2a312741973c06ad",
      "text": "大家都在吗……？\n啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000206:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab4b942e1dfcd016359bb1b4637730c4517d321ad026d9864f20b673406ed372",
      "text": "隼人，生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000224:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4446a05f2703d21314084ceaa8f3f1b167925aa11415a02379d6925bb0edd911",
      "text": "谢、谢谢……大家……！\n真的为我准备了这一切……呜呜……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000238:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d9a2d8fc6843c93e8774eea3a8a69adeac984ba2824dd898f7dc58822ae6e1f",
      "text": "别哭啦，隼人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000244:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2abd8f06d7e7d3b2b76b7b904b1e3f604f80f0ffb037c26ce589ce018a25230a",
      "text": "就是啊！不过竟然高兴到哭出来……\n惊喜大获成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000255:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b105d62fc9900f6ccd93267b268958e13de6d0d50fa407bbd03e90583012e002",
      "text": "……太好了呢，旬先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000259:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c312e4e6af68b62cc85c66c7537cc8bdedb97e7b117a7cec4a73592535bf07f0",
      "text": "嗯。能平安无事地办完真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000272:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35eec1fdcc561f28b43b01f7ef345f20e7a9eb0b9465e111c5eb355d1b0123d9",
      "text": "好啦，擦擦眼泪快到这边来。\n收下我们送你的礼物吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000287:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccfbf110c630fa0aa7c9e68a612f6b8034235dbb5eae4d3f74e897005c200f63",
      "text": "谢谢你们……！\n嘿嘿，真期待拆开它。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000316:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33fffd73d35ece92627f0acce70b7ccde4fb56c0a082a908705a35bed112b031",
      "text": "今天多亏了大家，让我度过了最棒的生日。\n真的太谢谢你们了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
